<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Unilever raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Unilever raised to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it upgraded Unilever Group to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- A Deutsche Morgan report cited Unilever's strong year-end results and the planned divestment of its chemicals business.</p>
<p>-- set a six-month price target of $190 on Unilever NV's shares, which were up 3/4 at 179-1/8 in New York Stock Exchange trading.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
